{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "homelab-overview",
  "title": "Homelab Overview",
  "tags": ["homelab", "overview"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 38,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Prometheus Targets Up",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up == 1)",
          "legendFormat": "up",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Prometheus Targets Down",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "thresholds": {
            "steps": [
              {"value": null, "color": "green"},
              {"value": 1, "color": "red"}
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "gridPos": {"x": 6, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(up == 0) or vector(0)",
          "legendFormat": "down",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Running Containers",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "count(container_last_seen)",
          "legendFormat": "containers",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Log Lines (rate)",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {"type": "loki", "uid": "loki"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 18, "y": 0, "w": 6, "h": 4},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate({job=~\".+\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "lines/s",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Fleet CPU % (avg)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 - (avg by (instance) (rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode=\"idle\"}[5m])) * 100)",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Fleet Memory %",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": {"type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus"},
      "gridPos": {"x": 12, "y": 4, "w": 12, "h": 8},
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "(node_memory_MemTotal_bytes - node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes) / node_memory_MemTotal_bytes * 100",
          "legendFormat": "{{instance}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "Dashboard collection",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {"x": 0, "y": 12, "w": 24, "h": 6},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Provisioned dashboards\n\n| Dashboard | Focus |\n| --- | --- |\n| **Homelab Overview** | Fleet health summary (this page) |\n| **Node Exporter** | Per-host CPU, memory, disk, network |\n| **Containers** | Docker/cAdvisor container metrics |\n| **Postgres** | Database performance |\n| **Redis** | Cache hit rates and memory |\n| **Logs** | Loki log exploration |\n| **Media Cache** | Rclone cache throughput |\n\nDatasources: **Prometheus**, **Loki**, **Redis (Infra/Dev)** — file-provisioned under `config/grafana/provisioning/`."
      }
    }
  ]
}
